{
  "an3.121:0.1": "Aṅguttara Nikāya 3.121 ",
  "an3.121:0.2": "12. Āpāyikavagga ",
  "an3.121:0.3": "Dutiyasoceyyasutta ",
  "an3.121:1.1": "“Tīṇimāni, bhikkhave, soceyyāni. ",
  "an3.121:1.2": "Katamāni tīṇi? ",
  "an3.121:1.3": "Kāyasoceyyaṁ, vacīsoceyyaṁ, manosoceyyaṁ. ",
  "an3.121:1.4": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, kāyasoceyyaṁ? ",
  "an3.121:1.5": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu pāṇātipātā paṭivirato hoti, adinnādānā paṭivirato hoti, abrahmacariyā paṭivirato hoti. ",
  "an3.121:1.6": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, kāyasoceyyaṁ. ",
  "an3.121:2.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, vacīsoceyyaṁ? ",
  "an3.121:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu musāvādā paṭivirato hoti, pisuṇāya vācāya paṭivirato hoti, pharusāya vācāya paṭivirato hoti, samphappalāpā paṭivirato hoti. ",
  "an3.121:2.3": "Idaṁ vuccati, bhikkhave, vacīsoceyyaṁ. ",
  "an3.121:3.1": "Katamañca, bhikkhave, manosoceyyaṁ? ",
  "an3.121:3.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu santaṁ vā ajjhattaṁ kāmacchandaṁ: ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ kāmacchando’ti pajānāti; asantaṁ vā ajjhattaṁ kāmacchandaṁ: ‘natthi me ajjhattaṁ kāmacchando’ti pajānāti; yathā ca anuppannassa kāmacchandassa uppādo hoti, tañca pajānāti; yathā ca uppannassa kāmacchandassa pahānaṁ hoti, tañca pajānāti; yathā ca pahīnassa kāmacchandassa āyatiṁ anuppādo hoti, tañca pajānāti; ",
  "an3.121:3.3": "santaṁ vā ajjhattaṁ byāpādaṁ: ‘atthi me ajjhattaṁ byāpādo’ti pajānāti; asanta�